WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
TaskNest, a full-stack task management app.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Create tasks quickly with a clean and simple interface.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Organize work with Today, Tomorrow, and All Tasks views.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Track progress with secure JWT login and task persistence.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Filter, update, and manage tasks with responsive controls.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
Built with Node.js, Express, MongoDB, and vanilla JavaScript.